OL,3,ABoat carrying 267 people capsizes off
OL,4,Anorthern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger boat carrying 259
OL,7,Fpassengers and eight crew members has
OL,8,Fcapsized off northern Cyprus
OL,10,FThe Turkish Interior Ministry says the
OL,11,Fship began taking on water and "was in
OL,12,Fdanger of sinking at a location 4
OL,13,Fnautical miles off Kyrenia Port" - an
OL,14,Fimage shows the boat on its side
OL,16,FA search and rescue operation
OL,17,Finitiated, it adds in a statement
OL,19,F"There has been a loss of life and
OL,20,Fthere are injuries," the prime minister
OL,21,Fof the self-declared Turkish Republic
OL,22,Fof Northern Cyprus says
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
